  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>terrain-cast-shadow-sweep · 2×1×1 workgroups × 64×1×1 lanes = 128 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-terrain-terrain-cast-shadow-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 64\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-terrain-terrain-cast-shadow-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"64\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"2\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAACAAAAACCAMAAAAOwC77AAAAA1BMVEVfZnJNNohmAAAATUlEQVR4AQFCAL3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEIAAb1u9mUAAAAASUVORK5CYII=\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>64 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const elevationValuesOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; elevationValues: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const settingsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; settings: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const hullOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; hull: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const visibilityValuesOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; visibilityValues: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const horizonValuesOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(4) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; horizonValues: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">const WIDTH: u32 = 64u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">const HEIGHT: u32 = 64u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">const NONE: u32 = 0xffffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">const MAXIMUM_RADIUS: f32 = 91.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">const PI: f32 = 3.141592653589793;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">const DEGREES_TO_RADIANS: f32 = 0.017453292519943295;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">const RADIANS_TO_DEGREES: f32 = 57.29577951308232;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">fn isFiniteValue(value: f32) -&gt; bool { return (bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(value) &amp; 0x7f800000u) != 0x7f800000u; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">// Takes a runtime operand (unlike the shared getNaN) so the NaN is not constant-folded away.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">fn getNaN(index: u32) -&gt; f32 { return bitcast&lt;f32&gt;(0x7fc00000u | (index &amp; 0u)); }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">fn getGroundCellSize(row: u32) -&gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">  let cellSize = vec2&lt;f32&gt;(settings[settingsOffset + 0u], settings[settingsOffset + 1u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">  return cellSize;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">var&lt;private&gt; sweepXMajor: bool;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">var&lt;private&gt; sweepSlopeFixed: i32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">var&lt;private&gt; sweepTravel: i32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">var&lt;private&gt; sweepMajorExtent: i32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">var&lt;private&gt; sweepMinorExtent: i32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">var&lt;private&gt; sweepLine: i32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">var&lt;private&gt; sweepZ: f32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">var&lt;private&gt; sweepCurvature: f32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">var&lt;private&gt; sweepMaximumDistance: f32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">var&lt;private&gt; sweepStepPixelLength: f32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">var&lt;private&gt; sweepPixelStep: f32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">var&lt;private&gt; sweepElevation: f32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">var&lt;private&gt; sweepMajor: i32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">fn getFixedOffset(slopeFixed: i32, major: i32) -&gt; i32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">  return (slopeFixed * major + 32768) &gt;&gt; 16u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">// Ground length of one major step on the pixel row, using the row&#39;s cell size.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">fn getStepLength(row: u32, xMajor: bool, slopeFixed: i32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">  let slope = f32(slopeFixed) / 65536.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">  let cell = getGroundCellSize(row);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">  return length(select(vec2&lt;f32&gt;(slope, 1.0), vec2&lt;f32&gt;(1.0, slope), xMajor) * cell);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">// Canonical elevation is NaN exactly where a pixel is invalid.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">fn isValidPixel(pixel: u32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  return isFiniteValue(elevationValues[elevationValuesOffset + pixel]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">fn getMajorIndex(pixel: u32) -&gt; i32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">  return i32(select(pixel / WIDTH, pixel % WIDTH, sweepXMajor));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">fn getDistanceIndex(pixel: u32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">  return f32(abs(getMajorIndex(pixel) - sweepMajor));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">// Hull-metric rise for the sample at distance index kf (curvature uses the reference step).\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">fn getRise(pixel: u32, kf: f32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">  return sweepZ * (elevationValues[elevationValuesOffset + pixel] - sweepElevation) -\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">    sweepCurvature * (kf * kf);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">// True when sample r has a strictly larger tangent than sample c (cross-multiplied, exact ties).\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">fn isGrowing(r: u32, c: u32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">  let kr = getDistanceIndex(r);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">  let kc = getDistanceIndex(c);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">  return getRise(r, kr) * kc &gt; getRise(c, kc) * kr;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">fn isInsideWindow(pixel: u32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">  let kf = getDistanceIndex(pixel);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">  return kf * sweepStepPixelLength &lt;= MAXIMUM_RADIUS &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">    (sweepMaximumDistance &lt;= 0.0 || kf * sweepPixelStep &lt;= sweepMaximumDistance);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">// First valid pixel strictly after c on the line, NONE at the end.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">fn getValidAfter(c: u32) -&gt; u32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">  let major = getMajorIndex(c) + sweepTravel;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">  if (major &lt; 0 || major &gt;= sweepMajorExtent) { return NONE; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">  let minor = sweepLine + getFixedOffset(sweepSlopeFixed, major);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">  if (minor &lt; 0 || minor &gt;= sweepMinorExtent) { return NONE; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">  let pixel = select(u32(major) * WIDTH + u32(minor), u32(minor) * WIDTH + u32(major), sweepXMajor);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">  return select(hull[hullOffset + pixel], pixel, isValidPixel(pixel));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">// Exact maximum over the in-window samples at or after start (start is valid and inside).\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">fn queryWindow(start: u32) -&gt; u32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">  var best = NONE;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">  var t = start;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">  loop {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">    if (t == NONE || !isInsideWindow(t)) { break; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">    var c = t;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">    var r = hull[hullOffset + c];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">    while (r != NONE &amp;&amp; isInsideWindow(r) &amp;&amp; isGrowing(r, c)) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">      c = r;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">      r = hull[hullOffset + r];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">    if (best == NONE) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">      best = c;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">    } else if (isGrowing(c, best)) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">      best = c;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"106\">    if (r == NONE || isInsideWindow(r)) { break; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"107\">    t = getValidAfter(c);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"108\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"109\">  return best;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"110\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"111\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"112\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"113\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"114\">@compute @workgroup_size(64)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"115\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"116\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"117\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"118\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"119\">  _ = &amp;elevationValues;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"120\">  _ = &amp;settings;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"121\">  _ = &amp;hull;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"122\">  _ = &amp;visibilityValues;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"123\">  _ = &amp;horizonValues;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"124\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"125\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"126\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"127\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"128\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 67108864u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"129\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 64u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"130\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"131\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"132\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"133\">  var xMajor = settings[settingsOffset + 10u] != 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"134\">  var slopeFixed = i32(settings[settingsOffset + 11u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"135\">  var travelSign = select(-1, 1, settings[settingsOffset + 12u] &gt; 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"136\">  var stepPixelLength = settings[settingsOffset + 13u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"137\">  let groundDirection = vec2&lt;f32&gt;(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"138\">    settings[settingsOffset + 14u],\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"139\">    settings[settingsOffset + 15u]\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"140\">  );\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"141\">  // The direction is a ground azimuth; on anisotropic cells the line follows the pixel direction\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"142\">  // of the reference row instead (CPU twin: getTerrainSweepGroundLineGeometry).\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"143\">  let referenceCell = getGroundCellSize(0u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"144\">  if (referenceCell.x != referenceCell.y &amp;&amp; all(referenceCell &gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt;(0.0)) &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"145\">      isFiniteValue(referenceCell.x + referenceCell.y) &amp;&amp; any(groundDirection != vec2&lt;f32&gt;(0.0))) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"146\">    let pixelDirection = groundDirection / referenceCell;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"147\">    xMajor = abs(pixelDirection.x) &gt;= abs(pixelDirection.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"148\">    let majorComponent = select(pixelDirection.y, pixelDirection.x, xMajor);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"149\">    let minorComponent = select(pixelDirection.x, pixelDirection.y, xMajor);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"150\">    slopeFixed = i32(round((minorComponent / majorComponent) * 65536.0));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"151\">    travelSign = select(-1, 1, majorComponent &gt; 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"152\">    stepPixelLength = length(vec2&lt;f32&gt;(1.0, f32(slopeFixed) / 65536.0));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"153\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"154\">  let majorExtent = select(HEIGHT, WIDTH, xMajor);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"155\">  let minorExtent = select(WIDTH, HEIGHT, xMajor);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"156\">  let lastOffset = getFixedOffset(slopeFixed, i32(majorExtent) - 1);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"157\">  let lineCount = i32(minorExtent) + abs(lastOffset);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"158\">  if (i32(index) &gt;= lineCount) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"159\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"160\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"161\">  sweepXMajor = xMajor;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"162\">  sweepSlopeFixed = slopeFixed;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"163\">  sweepTravel = travelSign;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"164\">  sweepMajorExtent = i32(majorExtent);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"165\">  sweepMinorExtent = i32(minorExtent);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"166\">  sweepLine = i32(index) - max(0, lastOffset);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"167\">  sweepZ = f32(1) * settings[settingsOffset + 2u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"168\">  let curvature = settings[settingsOffset + 3u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"169\">  sweepMaximumDistance = settings[settingsOffset + 6u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"170\">  sweepStepPixelLength = stepPixelLength;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"171\">  let referenceStep = getStepLength(0u, xMajor, slopeFixed);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"172\">  sweepCurvature = curvature * referenceStep * referenceStep;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"173\">  var previous = NONE;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"174\">  for (var stepIndex = 0; stepIndex &lt; sweepMajorExtent; stepIndex++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"175\">    let major = select(stepIndex, sweepMajorExtent - 1 - stepIndex, travelSign &gt; 0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"176\">    let minor = sweepLine + getFixedOffset(slopeFixed, major);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"177\">    if (minor &lt; 0 || minor &gt;= sweepMinorExtent) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"178\">      continue;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"179\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"180\">    let pixel = select(u32(major) * WIDTH + u32(minor), u32(minor) * WIDTH + u32(major), xMajor);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"181\">    let next = previous;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"182\">    previous = pixel;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"183\">    var firstAhead = NONE;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"184\">    if (next != NONE) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"185\">      firstAhead = select(hull[hullOffset + next], next, isValidPixel(next));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"186\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"187\">    var horizonAngle = getNaN(pixel);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"188\">    if (!isValidPixel(pixel)) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"189\">      hull[hullOffset + pixel] = firstAhead;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"190\">    } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"191\">      sweepElevation = elevationValues[elevationValuesOffset + pixel];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"192\">      sweepMajor = major;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"193\">      var tangent = firstAhead;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"194\">      if (tangent != NONE